        <mxCell id="rRuWnRXzLD0KB6MKMJC9-70" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Snippet (Evidence 1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;: &lt;i&gt;&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;We instituted temporary employee furloughs and compensation reductions while our U.S. operations were scaled back.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Score Card&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; {&quot;reason&quot;: &quot;Details labor furloughs and pay cuts—direct workforce impact.&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&quot;points&quot;: 4},&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&quot;reason&quot;: &quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;Indicates scaling back of operations, amplifying severity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&quot;points&quot;: 3&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&quot;reason&quot;: &quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;Measures were temporary, providing some mitigation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&quot;points&quot;: -1&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Score Calculation&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Total Risk Score = [+4] + [+3] + [-1] =&amp;nbsp; 6&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 😐&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; +&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;🥲&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;+&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;🙂&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; =&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;😟&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resoning Summary&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;Significant but time-bounded labor impacts produce a high, but not peak, risk score.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=2;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;sketch=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;convertToSvg=0;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;glass=0;shadow=0;backgroundOutline=0;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;spacing=7;labelBorderColor=none;textShadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
